# Input

```md
Some words before the strong text, **stop and tell
them** after the strong text.

Some words before the italic text, _stop and tell
them_ after the italic text.

Some words before the deleted text, ~~stop and tell
them~~ after the deleted text.

- List item with enough words, **strong text that
  continues** on the next line.

> Quote with enough words in it, **strong text that
> continues** on the next line.

Some words before the strong text, ***stop and tell
them*** after the strong text.

Paragraph with *foo ** bar* text.

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "formatter": {
      "proseWrap": "never",
      "lineWidth": 40,
      "indentStyle": "space"
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```md
Some words before the strong text, **stop and tell them** after the strong text.

Some words before the italic text, _stop and tell them_ after the italic text.

Some words before the deleted text, ~~stop and tell them~~ after the deleted text.

- List item with enough words, **strong text that continues** on the next line.

> Quote with enough words in it, **strong text that
> continues** on the next line.

Some words before the strong text, **_stop and tell them_** after the strong text.

Paragraph with _foo ** bar_ text.

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
    5: Some words before the deleted text, ~~stop and tell them~~ after the deleted text.
   12: Some words before the strong text, **_stop and tell them_** after the strong text.
```
